OL,3,GNEWSAResidents forced from homes in
OL,4,AOmagh security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of people have moved from
OL,7,Ftheir homes due to a security alert in
OL,8,FOmagh, County Tyrone.
OL,10,FPolice and Army Technical Officers are
OL,11,Fat the scene of the alert in
OL,12,FGardenville Avenue, which is off the
OL,13,FGortin Road.
OL,15,FCordons are in place at the scene of
OL,16,Fthe alert.
OL,18,FPolice have asked the public to avoid
OL,19,Fthe area at this time.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
